{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/01.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/FAMILY-FRIENDLY!.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Super Cloud Fight, a battle royale game where having fun is more important than winning. Gear up, goof off, and dive into the wildest ride where powerups and laughter reign supreme!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Battle_in_the_skies_with_friends.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/02.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your skills and reflexes in this mesmerizing aerial ballet with your friends, where every twist and turn is a step towards becoming the ultimate airborne champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/A_SQUAD_of_Silly_Spirit_Animals!.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/04.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the wildest squad in the clouds! Super Cloud Fight\u2019s silly spirit animals, like the tiger, panthers, and one speedy rabbit (and more to come) \u2014 are here to bring the fun and fluff to every sky battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Be_Bold_with_Painted_Planes.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/05.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why blend in when you can paint the skies? Customize your planes with bold colors and textures that show off your style and make your mark in our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/LOTS_OF_FUN_FEATURES.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The jet stream allows the player to recharge the plane and take a quick break from the dogfighting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/06.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boost your gameplay with a variety of powerups to gain the upper hand much like Super Mario Kart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/07.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zoom in for precision strikes or zoom out for the chaos! Master the skies with dynamic zoom and see your victories up close!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/08.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The throttle system lets you chase or evade enemies for adrenaline-pumping action supported by a radar view.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/09.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SkyPoints allows you to track your performance as a pilot. Earn more to unlock new characters and levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/10.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Ready_to_sky_battle_.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/11.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now to stay up-to-date with the latest development updates and be the first to know when Super Cloud Fight releases. Join our  community and get access to exclusive beta play sessions where you can help shape the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME_1_0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2697730/b78edce7c15d370f25d303e56c5ba5e04342cc35.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2697730?t=1751007388","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2697730?t=1751007388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/2d90bf58d1e7d59b3c5f9895a18fae32ab092928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751007388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/2d90bf58d1e7d59b3c5f9895a18fae32ab092928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751007388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Players battle it out using aircraft guns and fun power-up weapons. No blood or gore here\u2014just explosions, all in a light-hearted, cartoony style! \ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udca5"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3227860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83c\udf89 Special Announcement: Super Cloud Fight Demo is LIVE!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that the <strong>Super Cloud Fight</strong> <strong>demo is now available</strong> on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this early version, you can jump in and <strong>Play vs AI</strong> to get a taste of the action. Keep in mind, this is a <strong>work-in-progress</strong> demo \u2014 so you may encounter some bugs along the way. We\u2019re eager to hear your feedback and appreciate your patience as we continue to improve the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Coming in the full release</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play vs Friends</strong> \u2013 battle it out in private matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play vs Competitors</strong> \u2013 face off against challengers from around the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for supporting us during development. Stay tuned, and get ready for even more cloud-powered chaos! \u2601\ufe0f\u2694\ufe0f</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/01.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/FAMILY-FRIENDLY!.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Super Cloud Fight, a battle royale game where having fun is more important than winning. Gear up, goof off, and dive into the wildest ride where powerups and laughter reign supreme!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Battle_in_the_skies_with_friends.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/02.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your skills and reflexes in this mesmerizing aerial ballet with your friends, where every twist and turn is a step towards becoming the ultimate airborne champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/A_SQUAD_of_Silly_Spirit_Animals!.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/04.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the wildest squad in the clouds! Super Cloud Fight\u2019s silly spirit animals, like the tiger, panthers, and one speedy rabbit (and more to come) \u2014 are here to bring the fun and fluff to every sky battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Be_Bold_with_Painted_Planes.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/05.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why blend in when you can paint the skies? Customize your planes with bold colors and textures that show off your style and make your mark in our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/LOTS_OF_FUN_FEATURES.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The jet stream allows the player to recharge the plane and take a quick break from the dogfighting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/06.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boost your gameplay with a variety of powerups to gain the upper hand much like Super Mario Kart.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/07.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zoom in for precision strikes or zoom out for the chaos! Master the skies with dynamic zoom and see your victories up close!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/08.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The throttle system lets you chase or evade enemies for adrenaline-pumping action supported by a radar view.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/09.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SkyPoints allows you to track your performance as a pilot. Earn more to unlock new characters and levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/10.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/Ready_to_sky_battle_.png?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/extras/11.gif?t=1751007388\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now to stay up-to-date with the latest development updates and be the first to know when Super Cloud Fight releases. Join our  community and get access to exclusive beta play sessions where you can help shape the game.</p>","developers":["Engaged"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697730/27e8fdfd7ee10d3be346bca6ed4303db2255b9d8/header.jpg?t=1751007388","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Super Cloud Fight, and all associated logos, illustrations, images, names, characters, races, airplanes, locations, weapons, powerups and the distinctive likeness thereof, are either \u00ae or TM, and/or \u00a9 Engaged AS, variably registered around the world, and used under license. All rights reserved to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu &gt;= 20.04, Arch, or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> For 720p: Radeon R9 270, GeForce GTX 670 (Kepler architecture, driver 472.12+), Intel Iris Xe, or similar (with 2+ GB of VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes, please<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Only X11 right now (bugs with Wayland). In desktop mode, a mouse with 2 buttons + scroll wheel is necessary for camera control.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu &gt;= 20.04, Arch, or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> For 1080p: Radeon RX 580, GeForce GTX 1060, Intel Arc A380, or similar (with 4+ GB of VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Absolutely<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Only X11 right now (bugs with Wayland). In desktop mode, a mouse with 2 buttons + scroll wheel is necessary for camera control.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13.6 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 PRO 560 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13.6 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 PRO 580 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156780,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156780/movie480.mp4?t=1751007382","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156780/movie_max.mp4?t=1751007382"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156780/0bd724b7c7fae00311d484d4a2c53eeb8769a654/movie_60